    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `moderate_text.py` that scores user text for unsafe or policy-violating content using a concrete external provider, I will use the Perspective API by Jigsaw. This API is designed to detect toxic, rude, or otherwise problematic comments. I will import the necessary libraries and write the code to make a request to the Perspective API. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789861810421,
          "start": 1789861807692
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc13c64c001TUZUCTDLPFQA3G",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc13bfc9001kKVWrADX1kWIbu",
